      "content": "SP 90 SE                          ASHLEY GREEN            WHELPLEY HILL 2/19                                                           Barn to West of Berry                                                           Farmhouse GV                                                           II C18 timber-framed and weatherboarded barn of 5 bays.  Slate west slope to roof.  Old tile roof slope to east.  Cart entry at north and lean-to to each side.  Modern gable entry.  Curved tie beam braces.  Braced purlins and wall plates.  Curved queen post trusses. Listing NGR: SP9993404428"
    }
